@api = http://localhost:5013
@keycloak = http://localhost:8081/realms/tcc/protocol/openid-connect/token

### 0. Token de TMS (client credentials contra Keycloak local; vence en 5 min)
# @name tokenTms
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=tms&client_secret=tms-secreto-solo-local

### 1. Evento válido → 202 (repetirlo → 200 DUPLICADO)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/eventos-guia
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTms.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idEvento": "0199a1b2-7c3d-7e4f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a5b",
  "numeroGuia": "TCC123456789",
  "estado": "EN_REPARTO",
  "ocurridoEn": "2026-09-26T10:15:00-05:00",
  "origen": "TMS",
  "novedad": null
}

### 2. Contrato inválido → 400 con todos los errores
POST {{api}}/api/v1/eventos-guia
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTms.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idEvento": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "numeroGuia": "TCC-1",
  "estado": "PERDIDA",
  "origen": "TMS"
}

### 3. JSON mal formado → 400 (no 500)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/eventos-guia
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTms.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idEvento":

### 4. TMS reportando un evento de TRANSPORTE → 403 (suplantación)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/eventos-guia
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTms.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idEvento": "0199a1b2-7c3d-7e4f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a5c",
  "numeroGuia": "TCC123456789",
  "estado": "ENTREGADA",
  "ocurridoEn": "2026-09-26T11:00:00-05:00",
  "origen": "TRANSPORTE"
}

### 5. Sin token → 401
POST {{api}}/api/v1/eventos-guia
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Sondas (sin token)
GET {{api}}/salud/lista

### 7. Token del portal de rastreo (solo guias:leer)
# @name tokenPortal
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=portal-consulta&client_secret=portal-secreto-solo-local

### 8. Estado e historial de la guía (tras el 202 del paso 1, en pocos segundos)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/guias/TCC123456789
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPortal.response.body.$.access_token}}
